#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:555
msgid "5.2 Atlas 800 A2 Deployment"
msgstr "5.2 Atlas 800 A2部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:557
msgid "5.2.1 Eight-Node Mixed Deployment"
msgstr "5.2.1 八节点混合部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:559
msgid ""
"The validated Atlas 800 A2 deployment uses eight nodes with eight NPUs per "
"node. Each node runs one DP rank and uses all eight local NPUs for tensor "
"parallelism. Every DP rank handles both Prefill and Decode, resulting in a "
"DP8/TP8/EP64 topology. Node 0 runs the API server and DP rank 0, while Nodes"
" 1 through 7 run headless DP workers. This baseline serves the language "
"model only."
msgstr ""
"已验证的Atlas 800 A2部署使用八个节点，每个节点配备八个NPU。每个节点运行一个DP rank，并使用所有八个本地NPU进行张量并行。每个DP"
" rank同时处理Prefill和Decode，形成DP8/TP8/EP64拓扑。节点0运行API服务器和DP rank "
"0，节点1至7运行无头DP工作节点。此基线仅服务于语言模型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:565
msgid ""
"Start Node 0 first. The `NODE0_IP` configured on Nodes 1 through 7 must "
"equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node 0."
msgstr "首先启动节点0。节点1至7上配置的`NODE0_IP`必须等于节点0上的`LOCAL_IP`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:566
msgid ""
"Assign a unique `DP_START_RANK` from `1` through `7` to each worker node."
msgstr "为每个工作节点分配一个从`1`到`7`的唯一`DP_START_RANK`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:567
msgid ""
"Ensure proxy bypass settings include all API and communication IP addresses "
"used by the eight nodes."
msgstr "确保代理绕过设置包含八个节点使用的所有API和通信IP地址。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "Nodes 1-7"
msgstr "节点1-7"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:638
msgid ""
"Run this command on every worker node. Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` to the "
"current node and set `DP_START_RANK` to a unique value from `1` through `7`."
msgstr ""
"在每个工作节点上运行此命令。将`LOCAL_IP`和`NIC_NAME`设置为当前节点，并将`DP_START_RANK`设置为从`1`到`7`的唯一值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "Each node uses its own communication IP address."
msgstr "每个节点使用自己的通信IP地址。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "Workers do not expose an API endpoint."
msgstr "工作节点不暴露API端点。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "`0`"
msgstr "`0`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "Unique value from `1` through `7`"
msgstr "从`1`到`7`的唯一值"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "Every node owns one global DP rank."
msgstr "每个节点拥有一个全局DP rank。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:713
msgid "Key A2 deployment parameters:"
msgstr "关键A2部署参数："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "`--tensor-parallel-size 8`"
msgstr "`--tensor-parallel-size 8`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "Uses all eight NPUs in one A2 node for tensor parallelism."
msgstr "使用一个A2节点中的所有八个NPU进行张量并行。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "`--data-parallel-size 8`"
msgstr "`--data-parallel-size 8`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "Creates eight global DP ranks across eight nodes."
msgstr "在八个节点上创建八个全局DP rank。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "`--language-model-only`"
msgstr "`--language-model-only`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "Disables the multimodal encoder for this validated A2 baseline."
msgstr "为此已验证的A2基线禁用多模态编码器。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "`--max-model-len 262144`"
msgstr "`--max-model-len 262144`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid "Sets a 256K combined input and output context limit."
msgstr "设置256K的输入和输出组合上下文限制。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid ""
"Uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph replay with capture sizes `1`, `2`, `4`, and "
"`8`."
msgstr "使用`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`图回放，捕获大小为`1`、`2`、`4`和`8`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:634
msgid ""
"Enables NPU graph execution and CPU binding while keeping FlashComm1 "
"disabled."
msgstr "启用NPU图执行和CPU绑定，同时保持FlashComm1禁用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:725
msgid ""
"Do not set `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=AIV` for this baseline. Start Node 0 "
"first, then start Nodes 1 through 7 as soon as possible. If a worker exits "
"immediately, verify that Node 0 is running, all nodes use the same RPC port,"
" `--data-parallel-address` resolves to Node 0, and every worker has a unique"
" DP start rank."
msgstr ""
"不要为此基线设置`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=AIV`。首先启动节点0，然后尽快启动节点1至7。如果工作节点立即退出，请验证节点0正在运行、所有节点使用相同的RPC端口、`--data-"
"parallel-address`解析到节点0，并且每个工作节点具有唯一的DP起始rank。"

