"The validated A2 deployment uses `--language-model-only`. After all eight DP"
" ranks are ready, send a text request to the Node 0 API endpoint:"
msgstr "已验证的A2部署使用`--language-model-only`。所有八个DP rank就绪后，向节点0 API端点发送文本请求："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:776
msgid ""
"The service should return HTTP 200 and a `choices` field containing "
"generated text. Nodes 1 through 7 are headless workers and do not accept "
"HTTP requests directly."
msgstr "服务应返回HTTP 200和包含生成文本的`choices`字段。节点1至7是无头工作节点，不直接接受HTTP请求。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:778
msgid ""
"`X-data-parallel-rank` is an optional HTTP request header that pins a "
"request to a specific DP rank. Without this header, the internal vLLM load "
"balancer on Node 0 selects an available rank. For this DP8 deployment, use "
"an integer from `0` through `7` only when validating one rank, "
"troubleshooting a worker, or testing rank-local prefix-cache behavior:"
msgstr ""
"`X-data-parallel-rank`是一个可选的HTTP请求头，用于将请求固定到特定的DP "
"rank。没有此头时，节点0上的内部vLLM负载均衡器会选择一个可用rank。对于此DP8部署，仅在验证单个rank、排查工作节点问题或测试rank本地前缀缓存行为时使用从`0`到`7`的整数："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:784
msgid ""
"Production traffic should normally omit this header so that requests remain "
"balanced across all DP ranks. The request is always sent to the Node 0 API "
"endpoint, even when a worker rank is selected."
msgstr "生产流量通常应省略此头，以便请求在所有DP rank之间保持均衡。即使选择了工作节点rank，请求也始终发送到节点0 API端点。"

